# Java Conventions

- Follow project's existing code style (check neighboring files before writing)
- LWJGL native resources must be explicitly freed (no relying on GC)
- Vulkan error codes must be checked at every API call
- Memory barriers required between compute and graphics pipeline stages
- Keep shader code in src/main/resources/shaders/
